SUMMARY:COMING JUNE 5th | Yonder Mountain String Band
DESCRIPTION:Venue Presale: March 11 at 10am EST (PW: FIVESTRING) \nFriday\, June 5th\, 2026 | Doors at 6:00PM | Music at 7:00PM | $33.17 adv. Event Details and Tickets \nExperience the high-energy bluegrass sounds of Yonder Mountain String Band as they take the outdoor stage for one\, not-to-be-missed concert!. This acclaimed quintet blends traditional bluegrass with progressive rock and jam band influences\, creating a unique and captivating live performance. \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-june-5th-yonder-mountain-string-band/2026-05-13/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/656010021_1410429764444529_7338696287452909343_n-e1774378609514.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
